--------------------------------------------------

             Summary: Fix the transition to CandidateState
                 Key: KAFKA-17067
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17067
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Jos=C3=A9 Armando Garc=C3=ADa Sancio
            Assignee: Jos=C3=A9 Armando Garc=C3=ADa Sancio
             Fix For: 3.9.0


Only voters should be able to transition to CandidateState. The current cod=
e allows VotedState to transition to CandidateState. Not all VotedState are=
 voters.

This was relaxed as part of KIP-853. No-voters are allowed to vote for lead=
ers even though they locally think they are not voters.



