PoAn Yang created KAFKA-17110:
---------------------------------

             Summary: Enable valid test case in KafkaConsumerTest for AsyncKafkaConsumer
                 Key: KAFKA-17110
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17110
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: PoAn Yang
            Assignee: PoAn Yang


Enable testSubscription, verifyPollTimesOutDuringMetadataUpdate, testFetchStableOffsetThrowInCommitted, testFetchStableOffsetThrowInPosition, testNoCommittedOffsets, testPollThrowsInterruptExceptionIfInterrupted, fetchResponseWithUnexpectedPartitionIsIgnored, testManualAssignmentChangeWithAutoCommitEnabled, testManualAssignmentChangeWithAutoCommitDisabled, testOffsetOfPausedPartitions, and testCloseShouldBeIdempotent for AsyncKafkaConsumer



