Hi, Artem,

Thanks for the reply and sorry for the late reply.

45. Since this KIP changes the format of TransactionLogValue, we need all
brokers on a version that supports the new format for 2PC to work. This is
not enforced by using a broker config transaction.two.phase.commit.enable.
If we use a new transaction.version feature, we could enforce that.

46. Do we need any new error code for InitProducerIdResponse, if the broker
receives the new version of InitProducerIdRequest but hasn't enabled
transaction.two.phase.commit.enable?

Thanks,

Jun

