> h3. Steps to Reproduce:
> 1. Start a connect worker with Service loading enabled and with certain c=
onnector plugins in plugin path (e.g. AzureBlobSource & BigQuerySink)
> 2. Observe ServiceConfigurationError during plugin discovery
> h3. Current Behavior:
> ServiceConfigurationError is thrown with message "com.fasterxml.jackson.d=
atabind.Module: <module-name> not a subtype"
> Where <module-name> can be one of: -=C2=A0
>  * com.fasterxml.jackson.module.jaxb.JaxbAnnotationModule
>  * com.fasterxml.jackson.datatype.jsr310.JavaTimeModule
>  * com.fasterxml.jackson.datatype.guava.GuavaModule
>  * com.fasterxml.jackson.datatype.joda.JodaModule
> h3. Proposed Solution:
> Explicitly register the Afterburner module instead of using findAndRegist=
erModules().
