444f9d2f/core/src/test/scala/unit/kafka/log/LogManagerTest.scala#L968
> [1] https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/808498e9391dab292a7ccd8a0bf3713f=
444f9d2f/core/src/main/scala/kafka/log/LogManager.scala#L434
> [2] https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/808498e9391dab292a7ccd8a0bf3713f=
444f9d2f/storage/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/storage/internals/epoch/Lea=
derEpochFileCache.java#L351
> [3] https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/808498e9391dab292a7ccd8a0bf3713f=
