Hi Jun,

Thanks for feedback,

> 45. ... If we use a new transaction.version feature, we could enforce
that.

Updated Compatibility, Deprecation, and Migration Plan section to mention
that we're going to bump transaction.version feature and gate 2PC behind
the feature flag.

> 46. Do we need any new error code for InitProducerIdResponse ...

The current proposal is to return TRANSACTIONAL_ID_AUTHORIZATION_FAILED, as
the flag basically denies 2PC access at the broker level.  Another option
is to return UNSUPPORTED_VERSION, but I think it would be less intuitive as
the cluster version supports the feature, but the admin denied the access.
Alternatively, we can come up with a new code.  Let me know if you think
that we need some kind of TWO_PHASE_COMMIT_DISABLED error.

-Artem


