rectory failure after a configurable amount of time =E2=80=94 {{log.dir.fai=
lure.timeout.ms}}=C2=A0=E2=80=94 and it is the leader for any replicas in t=
he failed log directory the broker will shutdown, as that is the only other=
 way to guarantee that the controller will elect a new leader for those par=
titions.



