Review Comment:
   My understanding, especially wrt JBOD in KRaft, is that we may flag new features as EA if we release them with serious bugs or limitations that users may find surprising.
   
   I think the concept of "production ready", or GA, arises naturally from the negation of the term EA. I don't know if these terms should mean anything more than just "not EA".



