Hi, Mickael,

Thanks for the KIP.

10. A common case is only one log dir per broker. Could we support sth
like --add-config cordoned.log.dirs=3D* to make it more convenient for this
case?

11. Since we changed the metadata record format, should we gate the new
configuration based on a new metadata version?

Jun

On Wed, Jul 17, 2024 at 9:18=E2=80=AFAM Mickael Maison <mickael.maison@gmai=
l.com>
