Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-17199:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: add unit tests for TransactionLogConfigs and TransactionStateManagerConfigs
                 Key: KAFKA-17199
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17199
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Test
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


This is a follow-up of https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17195

`transaction-coordinator` module has no tests and that is prone to cause build failure (since we normally assume each module has tests). Hence, adding tests not only increase test coverage but also fix possible bugs.



