remote.storage.enable=3Dfalse
remote.log.delete.on.disable=3Dfalse (default)
If the topic config is set to this, or changed to this, we'll return
ConfigException during validation.

Pardon me, I'm a bit confused.

when `remote.storage.enable=3Dtrue`, `remote.log.delete.on.disable=3Dfalse`=
 is
no-op
when `remote.storage.enable=3Dfalse`, `remote.log.delete.on.disable=3Dfalse=
` is
error

If `remote.log.delete.on.disable` must be true when setting
`remote.storage.enable`
to false, does it mean changing `remote.storage.enable` to false is
expected to delete remote storage topic data"?

 If so, what is the purpose of `remote.log.delete.on.disable=3Dfalse`?

Best,
Chia-Ping

