Greg Harris created KAFKA-17202:
-----------------------------------

             Summary: EosIntegrationTest.verifyChangelogMaxRecordOffsetMatchesCheckpointedOffset leaks consumers
                 Key: KAFKA-17202
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17202
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Test
          Components: streams
    Affects Versions: 3.9.0
            Reporter: Greg Harris


This method creates a KafkaConsumer, but does not close it.

We can use a try-with-resources to ensure the consumer is closed prior to returning or throwing from this function.



