             Summary: KafkaStreamsCloseOptionsIntegrationTest.before leaks AdminClient
                 Key: KAFKA-17204
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17204
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Test
