Luke Chen created KAFKA-17205:
---------------------------------

             Summary: Allow topic config validation in controller level 
                 Key: KAFKA-17205
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17205
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Luke Chen
            Assignee: Luke Chen


Allow topic config validation in controller level. This is required because we need to fail the invalid config change before it is written into metadata log, especially for tiered storage feature.



