             Summary: Clients : Optimise batching of requests per node in S=
hareConsumeRequestManager
                 Key: KAFKA-17217
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17217
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Shivsundar R
            Assignee: Shivsundar R


In ShareConsumeRequestManager, currently every time we perform a commitSync=
 or commitAsync, we create one ShareAcknowledge RPC for the same. Here, we =
can optimise the number of RPC calls by batching the acknowledgements befor=
e the next poll is invoked per node.=C2=A0
This will ensure that between 2 calls, the acknowledgements are accumulated=
 in one request per node and then sent during poll, resulting in lesser RPC=
 calls,



