Hi Igor,

Correct. The whole point of 3.9 is to complete KIP-853. We had many email threads on this :)

As release manager I have discretion to delay the release until this is complete. And I will do that. But I do not think the delay will be more than a few days, based on what we're looking at now.

If you have a feature that you've been waiting for 4.0 for, then you are unblocked. Please feel free to add it to trunk.

best,
Colin


